## Model vs algorithm

Do not confuse:

- **model** — mathematical function producing predictions;
- **parameters** — values inside the model;
- **loss** — measures prediction error;
- **optimization algorithm** — changes parameters to reduce loss.

This separation is foundational.

The distribution of sample means is itself a random quantity.

